<li>Record requested plugin identity and resolved content digest as separat=
e audit fields.</li>
<li>Fail closed on mismatch/ambiguous refs.</li>
<li>Disable or gate background plugin updates where provenance cannot be re=
-attested.</li>
<li>Treat plugin execution authority independently from marketplace review =
status.</li>
<li>Alert when an installed plugin=E2=80=99s resolved digest changes withou=
t a corresponding approved manifest transition.</li>
<li>Constrain plugin host access to secrets, CI tokens and signing material=
